  "consumed": "Ol' Donkey Primary",
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium) per dose<br>\n<strong>Type:</strong> Street Drug</p>\n<p>Primary (4 hours): MOVE and REF -1 (minimum 1); BODY +3 to a maximum of 11, without raising HP or Death Save (check the cap and HP by hand). With BODY 12+, +3 to BODY-based checks instead. No -2 penalty to Brawling, Martial Arts, and Melee Weapon checks while in a Grapple. You're overconfident and loud. Secondary (DV17): addiction. While addicted and not on Ol' Donkey: BODY -3 (minimum 1), without lowering HP or Death Save.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>While addicted, switch on the \"Ol' Donkey Addiction\" effect.</li>\n<li>When an addicted character doses, use \"Ol' Donkey Addicted Primary\" instead of the normal primary effect; it cancels the withdrawal penalties for the duration.</li>\n<li>Stat and skill changes are automated; caps, minimums, durations, and everything else are not.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Gear, Drugs, &amp; Frames &gt; Consumables &gt; Street Drugs).</em></p>"
